        L("A：你什么时候出发？B：吃了早饭就出发。", "A: Nǐ shénme shíhou chūfā? B: Chī le zǎofàn jiù chūfā.", "A: When are you leaving? B: Right after breakfast.", "A: Kamu berangkat kapan? B: Habis sarapan langsung berangkat."),
